      "message": "feat(motion): a laser profile generator on the shared sheet laws\n\nThe waterjet generator's refusals and notes read a voice from its\nparams (Voice gets a short note word), so motion::laser::laser_profile\nrides the same planner, tabs and emitter as \"laser profile\", with a\npower door (more than 0, at most 100 % of the source's maximum). Every\nwaterjet sentence and the waterjet golden CL are unchanged.\n\nRefs #4081\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
